    "scrub_story": {
      "type": "sugar-scrub-story",
      "settings": {
        "review_quote": "I've tried the oatmeal scrub — smelled so good and I didn't want to get out of the shower!",
        "review_author": "— @iamsheilasnow",
        "step_1_title": "Exfoliate gently",
        "step_1_text": "<p>Massage onto damp skin using light circular motions. Let the sugar do the work rather than pressing hard.</p>",
        "step_2_title": "Focus on rough spots",
        "step_2_text": "<p>Spend a little extra time on elbows, knees, legs, and other areas that tend to feel dry or textured.</p>",
        "step_3_title": "Rinse clean",
        "step_3_text": "<p>Rinse thoroughly with warm water and pat your skin dry instead of rubbing.</p>",
        "step_4_title": "Follow with moisture",
        "step_4_text": "<p>Finish with your favorite body moisturizer or oil while skin still feels slightly damp.</p>",
        "ritual_heading": "Build your body-care ritual.",
        "ritual_text": "<p>A sugar scrub works best as one step in a simple routine: soften with water, exfoliate gently, rinse, then moisturize.</p>",
        "card_1_image": "shopify://shop_images/cb9fdb0a-3648-4f94-b580-1960c244f4b5.png",
        "card_1_heading": "Start with damp skin",
        "card_1_text": "<p>Warm water helps prep the skin so the scrub can glide more comfortably. Scoop a small amount and work in gentle circles.</p>",
        "card_1_button_label": "Shop sugar scrubs",
        "card_1_button_link": "shopify://collections/whipped-sugar-scrub",
        "card_2_image": "shopify://shop_images/b0d2bd86-2ba5-451b-bc97-6e619aacd0f4.png",
        "card_2_heading": "Buff where you need it",
        "card_2_text": "<p>Give extra attention to rough-feeling areas, but keep the pressure light. More pressure does not mean better exfoliation.</p>",
        "card_2_button_label": "Shop sugar scrubs",
        "card_2_button_link": "shopify://collections/whipped-sugar-scrub",
        "card_3_image": "shopify://shop_images/4bc44a8b-e8ac-48a8-bcf1-ccdd0ffb01fb.png",
        "card_3_heading": "Finish with moisture",
        "card_3_text": "<p>After rinsing, pat dry and follow with a body moisturizer or oil to complete the routine and keep skin feeling comfortable.</p>",
        "card_3_button_label": "Shop sugar scrubs",
        "card_3_button_link": "shopify://collections/whipped-sugar-scrub",
        "page_background": "#ffffff",
        "accent_background": "#fee693",
        "card_background": "#fbe6c8",
        "text_color": "#000000"
      }
